//RS //! U12: supervised dev services (card c9jetpackgates).
//RS //!
//RS //! Covers:
//RS //!   * `jetpack services up/health/logs/wait/down` round-trips a fixture daemon;
//RS //!   * the project dev health gate blocks until a service is healthy, and
//RS //!     reports a clean E1261 (not a hang) when it never becomes so;
//RS //!   * a `services:` entry with a field jetpack's dev-runtime tier doesn't
//RS //!     recognize is a clean E1262, both from the project dev path and from
//RS //!     `jetpack services up` directly.
//RS 
